- U(1) gauge: ψ → e^{iθ}ψ leaves |ψ|² invariant
- Noether current: j^μ = (ρ, j) where ∂_μ j^μ = 0 (continuity equation)
- Probability current: j = (iℏ/2m)(ψ*∇ψ - ψ∇ψ*)
